                </li>
                <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                  <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST430" space=3D"preserve" shape=3D"rec=
t"></a>Pilots are expected to note the followings when taxiing during low v=
isibility:=20
                  <div class=3D"orderedlist" space=3D"preserve">
                    <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST431" space=3D"preserve" shape=3D"r=
ect"></a>
                    <ol class=3D"orderedlist P1_default" type=3D"a" space=
=3D"preserve">
                      <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                        <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST432" space=3D"preserve" shape=
=3D"rect"></a>Pilots and aircraft operators shall constantly be aware that =
during low visibility conditions the movement of aircraft and vehicles on t=
he airport may not be visible to the tower controller. This may prevent vis=
ual confirmation of an aircraft's adherence to taxi instructions. Pilots sh=
ould, therefore, exercise extreme vigilance and proceed cautiously under su=
ch conditions.
                      </li>
                      <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                        <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST433" space=3D"preserve" shape=
=3D"rect"></a>When visual difficulties are encountered, or at the first ind=
ication of becoming disoriented, pilots should immediately inform the contr=
oller.
                      </li>
                    </ol>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                  <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST434" space=3D"preserve" shape=3D"rec=
t"></a>Procedures:=20
