                      <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                        <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST436" space=3D"preserve" shape=
=3D"rect"></a>Stage-one Low Visibility Procedures: RVR is at or below 900M=
=20
                        <div class=3D"orderedlist" space=3D"preserve">
                          <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST437" space=3D"preserve" shap=
e=3D"rect"></a>
                          <ol class=3D"orderedlist P1_default" type=3D"i" s=
pace=3D"preserve">
                            <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                              <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST438" space=3D"preserve" =
shape=3D"rect"></a>ATIS broadcasts "Stage-one Low Visibility Procedures are=
 in effect".
                            </li>
                            <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                              <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST439" space=3D"preserve" =
shape=3D"rect"></a>Tower shall, in accordance with Air Traffic Management P=
rocedure, issue progressive taxiing instructions to aircraft when necessary=
.
                            </li>
                            <li class=3D"listitem" space=3D"preserve">
                              <a id=3D"IDS_WPL_LIST440" space=3D"preserve" =
shape=3D"rect"></a>Only one aircraft is allowed to operate on maneuvering a=
rea.
                            </li>
